--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Hister (vendor/hister, a git submodule at an upstream tag)
https://github.com/asciimoo/hister
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Shiori's Safari extension is Hister's own browser extension (webui/ext),
built from the submodule and patched at build time by scripts/build-extension.sh
(patches/); its source is never modified. Hister is licensed under the GNU
Affero General Public License v3.0, the same license as Shiori (see LICENSE).
Its source is at the upstream tag the submodule points to.

This repository carries no Hister logo: the Rooms switcher shows a neutral
glyph for Hister (see "The Machiya room icons" below). A build may supply
the logos itself (SHIORI_ROOM_LOGOS, a folder outside the repository).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
hister-safari
https://github.com/nburns/hister-safari
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Nick Burns's macOS Safari port of the Hister extension. Shiori's extension
build (scripts/build-extension.sh: the manifest merge and the background
shim's approach) started from it. hister-safari is licensed under the GNU
Affero General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SearXNG
https://github.com/searxng/searxng
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Rooms switcher links to a SearXNG instance with a neutral glyph; this
repository carries no SearXNG logo. SearXNG is licensed under the GNU
Affero General Public License v3.0 (see
LICENSE). Shiori talks to SearXNG over its JSON API and ships none of its
code.

